#: processes/sdlc/qa-publish.bpmn:56
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Runs both paths as fixed programs. It decides nothing that needs judgement: whether a token can write is read from the event, whether a push was accepted is the push's exit code (never its stderr — spike `3ds9` measured a harmless \"push negotiation failed; proceeding anyway\"), and what retention removes is `planPrune`'s rule. A PR whose state cannot be read is KEPT: could-not-determine never deletes."
msgstr ""

